<title>USA: Nalco completes Nutmeg acquisition.</title>
<headline>Nalco completes Nutmeg acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nalco Chemical Co said Tuesday it completed its acquisition of Nutmeg Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Nutmeg is a privately held water treatment company based in New Haven, Conn. Nalco said Nutmeg expects 1996 sales of about $9 million.</p>
<p>Nalco provides water treatment and process chemicals and services.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
